e freedom to steer wherever your heart desires.\n\nTo deliver the ultimate kayaking experience, we\u2019ve developed a brand-new physics engine. From the resistance of the water to the precise haptic feedback of every stroke\u2014it feels just like the real thing.\n\nExperience truly interactive water: watch as every stroke creates ripples that react just as they would in nature.", "short_description": "Navigate breathtaking landscapes in a kayak powered by a fully physics-based simulation."}]}, "developer_name": "TeamX", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/18LJhsv6vki92DobgAR6Rzwq9rLKEORW71Sqg_QQrU38/edit?tab=t.0", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TeamX", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://linktr.ee/RealKayak", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "it", "de", "es", "ru", "zh_CN", "zh_TW", "ja", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28187381784280330"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619148_910056451465308_9192821380955540461_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8Fpk6tvdZgQQ7kNvwGT-zKD&_nc_oc=AdrckJ3xfpqDOjrZcajjZ-U9rR1GYpRvqWw4n1bF0ytbghl7Qt8GsuZUpseIE2qxd6Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLRQohXDh8Y9HTEMbP5U8JpF